<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:60px;padding-right:25px;padding-bottom:19px;padding-left:25px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#252525;"><p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em; color:#000; font-family:Times; font-size:medium"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: helvetica,sans-serifhelvetica neue;">Hi {!Lead.Name},</span></span></p>
<div>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><!--StartFragment--></p>
<p data-end="425" data-start="207" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">We’re turning up the heat this summer with an exclusive <strong data-end="287" data-start="263">Retail Apparel Offer</strong> from Zig-Zag! Here’s your chance to stock up on best-selling Zig-Zag products <strong data-end="373" data-start="366">AND</strong> earn premium branded apparel — absolutely <strong data-end="424" data-start="416">FREE</strong>.</p>
<p data-end="673" data-start="427" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><strong data-end="451" data-start="427">Here’s how it works:</strong><br data-end="454" data-start="451"/>📦 <strong data-end="466" data-start="457">Spend</strong> $500, $750, $1,000, or $2,000+ on Zig-Zag papers, cones, and accessories<br data-end="542" data-start="539"/>🎽 <strong data-end="555" data-start="545">Choose</strong> your favorite Zig-Zag T-shirt designs<br data-end="596" data-start="593"/>🎁 <strong data-end="610" data-start="599">Receive</strong> up to <strong data-end="635" data-start="617">48 FREE shirts</strong> — a retail value of up to <strong data-end="673" data-start="662">$1,200!</strong></p>
<p data-end="700" data-start="675" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><strong data-end="700" data-start="675">Spend More, Get More:</strong></p>
<ul data-end="851" data-start="701">
<li data-end="732" data-start="701">
<p data-end="732" data-start="703" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">$500+ = 6 shirts ($150 value)</p>
</li>
<li data-end="765" data-start="733">
<p data-end="765" data-start="735" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">$750+ = 12 shirts ($300 value)</p>
</li>
<li data-end="800" data-start="766">
<p data-end="800" data-start="768" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">$1,000+ = 20 shirts ($500 value)</p>
</li>
<li data-end="851" data-start="801">
<p data-end="851" data-start="803" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">$2,000+ = 48 shirts ($1,200 value – BEST VALUE!)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-end="997" data-start="853" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">💥 A variety of styles and sizes are available while supplies last.<br data-end="923" data-start="920"/>📌 <em data-end="997" data-start="926">Note: In case of limited stock, alternate designs may be substituted.</em></p>
<p data-end="1161" data-start="999" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">Don’t miss this high-value opportunity to reward your store, staff, or loyal customers with iconic Zig-Zag gear. Let’s make this summer your most stylish one yet!</p>
<p data-end="1242" data-start="1163" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><strong data-end="1242" data-start="1163">Ready to place your order or need help selecting designs? </strong></p>
<p data-end="1242" data-start="1163" style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><strong data-end="1242" data-start="1163">Let’s talk today!</strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"><!--EndFragment--></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"> </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"> </p>
</div></div>
</td>
